You can now turn into a bat \nand fly through the air.\kTo transform, press UP while\njumping.\kTo fly, just keep pressing\nthe jump button.\kYou can keep flying till you\nhit a wall. \e
Hold down the fire button to\nstore up firepower. \kWhen it becomes MAX, a more \npowerful flame can be shot. \kA MAX flame can penetrate   \nenemies and crack through \ntheir defenses. \e